usage: test_bsf_installed_qemu.py [-h] [--reset-grid-preferences]
                                  [--refresh-grid-payloads] [--desktop-grid]
                                  [--resume RESUME]

Install into a new private image, verify BSF bytes, apply and reboot. Uses the
ordinary release payload and installer GUI. All disk writes are to new
disposable files under .bsf-test; existing user disks are never attached.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --reset-grid-preferences
                        Initialize only a copied private fixture to Sans 16
                        before acceptance
  --refresh-grid-payloads
                        Refresh final WM and EFI kernel within existing
                        allocation in an offline private fixture before
                        booting
  --desktop-grid        Repeated family transitions and disk-only restart
                        anchor comparison
  --resume RESUME       Verify an already completed private test installation
